          "version": "1.0.2",
          "description": "## What's new in 1.0.2\n### Fixes\n- Reworked core logic to run on server boot only (periodic updates now optional)\n- Fixed live price fetching using [Tarkov DEV](tarkov.dev) API\n- Improved fallback handling when API is unavailable\n\n### New Features\n- Added support for PVE and PVP pricing modes\n  - pve → uses gameMode: pve\n  - pvp → maps to gameMode: regular\n- Added caching system (price.json) with expiration handling\n- Added optional periodic price updates via config\n- Added configurable API timeout and user agent\n- Improved logging for better debugging and visibility \n\n### Other Changes\n- Converted codebase from JavaScript to C# (SPT 4.0 compatible)\n- Switched to basePrice API method for simpler and more accurate pricing\n- Simplified and modernized config structure (config.json + price.json)",
